        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Randal Kleiser, Kyle Schickner, Peter Gallagher, Daryl Hannah, Valerie Quennessen\n- Films: Grease, Summer Lovers, Strange Fruit\n- Companies: FenceSitter Films\n- Roles: film director, producer, writer, actor, activist\n\nFacts:\n- John Randal Kleiser was born on July 20, 1946, and he is an American film director and producer.\n- Randal Kleiser is best known for directing the 1978 musical romantic comedy film Grease.\n- Summer Lovers is a 1982 American romantic comedy film written and directed by Randal Kleiser.\n- Summer Lovers stars Peter Gallagher, Daryl Hannah, and Valerie Quennessen.\n- Kyle Schickner is an American film producer, writer, director, actor, and bisexual civil rights activist.\n- Strange Fruit is a 2004 film written and directed by Kyle Schickner.\n- Strange Fruit was produced by FenceSitter Films.",
